OL,3,GNEWSAShopping centre demolition works
OL,4,Anearing completion
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemolition works on a Lancashire
OL,7,Fshopping centre are well under way as
OL,8,Fpart of a project to replace it with a
OL,9,Fmodern retail complex.
OL,11,FPendle Rise Shopping Centre in Nelson,
OL,12,Fwhich opened in the 1960s, shut its
OL,13,Fdoors in November.
OL,15,FA modern shopping centre will replace
OL,16,Fit with parking for 150 cars and
OL,17,Flandscaped outdoor areas as part of a
OL,18,F#25m government-backed Nelson Town Deal
OL,19,Fscheme.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
